! Elyncia 02 ~ The Lares DreamNet ~ Spine

The pilot book: smallest, highest citation density. The dry-old-node quote closes the walk as
the spine's own last breath.

''Spine law:'' the chunks live at their topical graph addresses; this spine holds the walk (the
reading order) and the mortar (the connective prose, written as chunks land). The kahea calls
below activate one by one as each chunk meme seats; until then the walk reads as the cut-plan.
''The source MD stays canonical until this spine renders the book whole.''

<<~/ahu>>

